  "description": "<!doctype html>\n<html class=\"no-js\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"/>\n    <title>The Nile on eBay</title>\n\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/ebay-assets/thenile/external-min.css\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/ebay-assets/thenile/nile-au.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"top-bar\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"medium-4 medium-offset-4 columns text-center\">\n                <img src='https://storage.googleapis.com/ebay-assets/thenile/thenile_logo_black.png' width='240'>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"expanded row content-divider\">\n        <div class=\"small-12 columns\">&nbsp;\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"small-12 medium-6 large-4 columns text-center\">\n            <img class=\"product-image\" src=\"https://images.thenile.io/r1000/9798855419641.jpg?t=1784612617\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"small-12 medium-6 large-8 columns\">\n            <h3>Love Unseen Beneath the Radiant Night Sky</h3>\n            <h5 class=\"subheader\">by\n                                            Amelia Imogen,                                             raemz                                    </h5>\n\n                        <p>On an April night in Tokyo, as the cherry blossoms are in bloom, blind university student Koharu Fuyutsuki spends time with the man she loves, Kakeru Sorano. In the three years since they started dating, he s shown just how much he cares about her, and even though Koharu can t see him, she can tell what a wonderful person he is. After all, Kakeru is the man who gave her a future. But just because they were gifted a miracle once, there s nothing to say it will continue forever. Pain and joy and all the vibrant hues in between color their lives like fireworks in the sky.</p>\n            \n           <div class='row primary-detail'>\n                        <div class='small-6 large-4 columns'><strong>FORMAT</strong><br>Paperback</div>\n                                    <div class='small-6 large-4 columns'><strong>CONDITION</strong><br>Brand New</div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"small-12 medium-10 medium-offset-1 columns\"><br><br>\n\n        \n\n                \n        <h4>Details</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"row product-attribute\">\n                            <div class='small-6 medium-4 columns'><strong>ISBN</strong></div>\n            \n                                        <div class=\"small-6 medium-4 columns\"><strong>Author</strong>\n                                            raemz\n                                    </div>\n                            <div class=\"small-6 medium-4 columns\"><strong>Series</strong>\n                                            Love Unseen Beneath the Clear Night Sky\n                                    </div>\n                            <div class=\"small-6 medium-4 columns\"><strong>Year</strong>\n                                            2026\n                                    </div>\n                            <div class=\"small-6 medium-4 columns\"><strong>Translator</strong>\n                                            Amelia Imogen\n                                    </div>\n                            <div class=\"small-6 medium-4 columns\"><strong>ISBN-13</strong>\n                                            9798855419641\n                                    </div>\n                            <div class=\"small-6 medium-4 columns\"><strong>Format</strong>\n                                            Paperback\n                                    </div>\n                            <div class=\"small-6 medium-4 columns\"><strong>Subtitle</strong>\n               